  "chapter": 6,
  "translation": "UElishiya wayehleli kwikhaya lakhe, namadala behleli ⟨את⟩ naye; inkosi yathumela umntu phambi kwayo. Ngaphambi kokuba umthunyi esofika kuye, yena wathetha kumadala: “Nibonile na ukuba unyana walommbulali uthumele ukususa ⟨את⟩ intloko yam? Bonani, exa umthunyi esofika, valani umnyango, nimtyhale ⟨את⟩ yena ngomnyango; asingakhe na izandi zeentyawu zenkosi yakhe emva kwakhe?”",
